 <header class="brand-header container"><RouterLink :to="`/platforms/${platform.slug}`" class="brand"><span class="subbrand-mark"><PlatformIcon :name="platform.icon" :size="27"/></span><span class="brand-copy"><strong>{{platform.name}}</strong><small>{{platform.eyebrow}}</small></span></RouterLink><nav aria-label="منوی مجموعه"><a href="#services">خدمات ما</a><a href="#doctors">متخصصان</a><RouterLink :to="`/platforms/${platform.slug}/overview`">درباره مجموعه</RouterLink></nav></header>
 <section class="brand-hero container"><div class="brand-hero-copy"><span class="brand-eyebrow">{{story.note[0]}}</span><h1>{{detail.headline}}</h1><p>{{detail.intro}}</p><a href="#booking" class="button brand-button">یک شروع، با همراهی متخصص<ArrowLeft :size="18"/></a><div class="brand-assurance"><CalendarDays :size="18"/><span>متخصص، روز و ساعت را خودتان انتخاب کنید.</span></div></div><figure class="brand-photo"><img :src="detail.hero" :alt="detail.heroAlt" fetchpriority="high"/><figcaption><span>{{platform.eyebrow}}</span><strong>{{detail.caption}}</strong></figcaption></figure></section>
